  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia-Tanzania Interconnector Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Under the umbrella of the Investments in Regional Infrastructure Program (NDICI AFRICA/2021/043-421), the project aims to interconnect the Southern and Eastern Africa Power Pools (SAPP and EAPP) to enable regional power trade and increase the transmission capacity in Northern Zambia&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
